NOTICE

Memory Leak Fix (Itamio port for Minecraft 26.3)

This mod is an unofficial port of "Memory Leak Fix" by FX
(https://github.com/fxmorin/memoryLeakFix, LGPL-2.1-only, 38.8M
downloads on Modrinth, max Minecraft 1.20.4).

All credit for the original concept, design, and logic goes to FX.
This port was created by Itamio to bring the mod to Minecraft
26.3 (Fabric) because the original has not been updated to this
version.

Itamio does not take credit for any of the original assets or logic.
The code was updated to be compatible with Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric).
Port status: most of the original's leak fixes were absorbed by
Mojang in vanilla (the original's own notes state the entity
memories leak MC-260605 was fixed by Mojang in 1.19.4), and
several mixin targets no longer exist in 26.3. See README for the
per-fix breakdown.
